{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tTcMxWDeIM1794838771.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法國海軍在大西洋攔截一艘半潛航行器，檢獲一百四十六公斤可卡因。</p><p></p><p>法國海軍表示於上周四，攔截一艘半潛航行器，為軍方首次攔截此類船隻。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FRA.DRUG-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026q0cMNqJMku1794838804.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>是次行動，在配合美國南方聯合特遣隊的行動，由法國護衛艦在艦載直升機支援下，與美國海上巡邏機聯合執行。</p><p></p><p>法國海軍指，被檢獲的毒品已按1988年聯合國禁止非法販運，麻醉藥品和精神藥物公約，以及相關法國法律處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:39:08.943902+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:45:57.789353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:32:33.936123+00:00","content_hash":"261ed8aeb52552d6a4993739336ec2ada7ed4c93687fec134ac667fc228e4bb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:39:08.943902+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}